<title>CHINA: First Pacific Davies launches residential division.</title>
<headline>First Pacific Davies launches residential division.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property consultancy First Pacific Davies said on Tuesday it had launched a new residential division, FPD Realty Ltd, specialising in the marketing of luxury townhouses, apartments and duplexes in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>First Pacific Davies, a subsidiary of First Pacific Co Ltd, provides consultancy services, facilities management, and property management, leasing and valuation in commercial, industrial and retail and hotel property.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
